{
  "dom_id": "step-e15654",
  "name": "Example: Finding a Missing Number",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/7fbc79b1d259f645a8296be12c2748e5abb05d02217f3628e24ef20781f06c71.png)\n\n \n\nUse the model above to determine the missing number in the following division problem. \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/a6e6d8c0ba796c8226cc5931d1519010ac1b1606293b3c5a5cf8c8b268a37d15.svg)",
  "worked_solution": "Let's start by interpreting our model:\n\n- The model shows $\\color{blue}4$ wholes. Each whole is split into *fifths*.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/2096f3451d19fc44bccca9ebe3033e9af29878aa928ad05b102e391be3f76105.png)\n\n \n\n- The fifths are grouped, and each group contains ${\\color{red}{\\dfrac{2}{5}}}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/96bc693ffe7fa65c90758e0d86a7176b19f7a279cfff12607926e0350448fe42.png)\n\n \n\n- There are $\\color{purple} 10$ groups in total.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/1ebdc6bce6be33bbdd5fd7ff79a562c22e68103cebc8f0ded5ddac6833633989.png)\n\n \n\nSo, if we divide $\\color{blue}4$ wholes into groups of ${\\color{red}{\\dfrac{2}{5}}},$ we get ${\\color{purple}{10}}$ groups in total.\n\nTherefore, the model represents the following division problem:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14144297/assets/d0d7d29b13dfc358b34ce869e927ebbda919dca0267e8c2289b012d0aa2ab8ac.svg)\n\nSo, the missing number is $\\bbox[3pt, Gainsboro]{\\color{red}\\dfrac{2}{5}}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e15654\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding a Missing Number </div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e15654\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><div id=\"graphic-168e45b1d12eb907c91ba0ca28141cb9\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/168e45b1d12eb907c91ba0ca28141cb9\"></div> \n\n<p>Use the model above to determine the missing number in the following division problem. \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"13.993ex\" height=\"6.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1724.2 6024.6 2802.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n4 \\div \\fbox{<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mphantom><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-mphantom></mjx-texatom><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mphantom><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mphantom></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>} = 10\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-F7\" d=\"M318 466Q318 500 339 518T386 537Q418 537 438 517T458 466Q458 438 440 417T388 396Q355 396 337 417T318 466ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H706Q721 262 721 250T706 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM318 34Q318 68 339 86T386 105Q418 105 438 85T458 34Q458 6 440 -15T388 -36Q355 -36 337 -15T318 34Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-34\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-F7\" x=\"722\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1945,0)\">\n<line stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"75\" y2=\"37\" y1=\"37\" x1=\"37\" x2=\"1706\" transform=\"translate(0,1543)\"></line>\n<line stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"75\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"37\" x1=\"37\" y2=\"2565\" transform=\"translate(1668,-985)\"></line>\n<line stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"75\" y2=\"37\" y1=\"37\" x1=\"37\" x2=\"1706\" transform=\"translate(0,-985)\"></line>\n<line stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"75\" y1=\"37\" x2=\"37\" x1=\"37\" y2=\"2565\" transform=\"translate(0,-985)\"></line>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"3967\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(5023,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>Let's start by interpreting our model:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The model shows <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\color{blue}4</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-34\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> wholes. Each whole is split into <em>fifths</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-87f6a28b4cef379c7dbbab8555b0aabe\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/87f6a28b4cef379c7dbbab8555b0aabe\"></div> \n\n<ul>\n<li>The fifths are grouped, and each group contains <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.645ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 1139 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">{\\color{red}{\\dfrac{2}{5}}}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,676)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\" transform=\"translate(60,-687)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-35\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"860\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-38b636ffcb7516ab0cb330781955a40a\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/38b636ffcb7516ab0cb330781955a40a\"></div> \n\n<ul>\n<li>There are <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.325ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1001 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\color{purple} 10</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-31\" d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"purple\" stroke=\"purple\">\n<g fill=\"purple\" stroke=\"purple\">\n<g fill=\"purple\" stroke=\"purple\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-31\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> groups in total.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-9f2529a4287c038b41ff233d75767bb5\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/9f2529a4287c038b41ff233d75767bb5\"></div> \n\n<p>So, if we divide <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\\color{blue}4</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-34\" d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E4-MJMAIN-34\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> wholes into groups of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.645ex\" height=\"5.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1437.2 1139 2228.5\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-5-Title\">{\\color{red}{\\dfrac{2}{5}}},</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-35\" d=\"M164 157Q164 133 148 117T109 101H102Q148 22 224 22Q294 22 326 82Q345 115 345 210Q345 313 318 349Q292 382 260 382H254Q176 382 136 314Q132 307 129 306T114 304Q97 304 95 310Q93 314 93 485V614Q93 664 98 664Q100 666 102 666Q103 666 123 658T178 642T253 634Q324 634 389 662Q397 666 402 666Q410 666 410 648V635Q328 538 205 538Q174 538 149 544L139 546V374Q158 388 169 396T205 412T256 420Q337 420 393 355T449 201Q449 109 385 44T229 -22Q148 -22 99 32T50 154Q50 178 61 192T84 210T107 214Q132 214 148 197T164 157Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=\"red\" stroke=\"red\">\n<g fill=